<title>JAPAN: Hitachi Credit UK unit to list shares in London.</title>
<headline>Hitachi Credit UK unit to list shares in London.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hitachi Credit Corp said on Thursday that a wholly owned subsidiary in Britain will list its shares in London on July 15.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said no other details were immediately available in Tokyo.</p>
<p>Jiji news agency reported on Wednesday that the unit would offer 14,814,815 shares at 135 pence per share, valuing the credit finance and leasing firm at 57.3 million pounds.</p>
</text>
